hiano</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Vallortigara</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Population lateralization and social behaviour: a study with 16 species of fish.</article-title><source>Laterality</source><volume>5</volume><fpage>269</fpage><lpage>284</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15513147</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001748-Winkler1"><label>34</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Winkler</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Roosts and Migrations of Swallows.</article-title><source>Hornero</source><volume>21</volume><fpage>85</fpage><lpage>97</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001748-Robertson1"><label>35</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Stutchbury</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name></person-group><year>1992</year><article-title>Tree Swallow (<italic>Tachycineta bicolour</italic>) The Birds of North America Online (A. Poole, Ed.)</article-title><publisher-loc>Ithaca</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Cornell Lab of Ornithology</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001748-Bisazza2"><label>36</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bisazza</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Pignatti</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Vallortigara</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>1997</year><article-title>Laterality in detour behaviour: interspecific variation in poeciliid fish.</article-title><source>Anim Behav</source><volume>54</volume><fpage>1273</fpage><lpage>1281</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9398380</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>This project was supported by NSF grant IBN-013437 to DWW. The funders had no role in any aspect of the study.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>